{"unit_id":"Marquez807__dsh-experience-memory#card-zh","repo":"Marquez807/dsh-experience-memory","commit":"e3fddecf171b3a02f5c892b72b30047c42449587","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"experience-memory（DSH 插件，适用于 DSH 客户端）：为不同工作区保存可验证的长期经验，并在相关任务出现时提供召回。它向系统提示注入按当前任务更新的经验摘要和记录提醒，提供记忆查询、记录、反馈、统计与遗忘工具，并在每轮结束时执行有界维护。记录会按证据分级，未核实的内容保留为候选；跨工作区的经验需独立印证后才能提升到领域范围，过时记录可退役。适合希望 DSH 在后续会话复用项目约定和经验的人。无需 API 密钥或外部账号，记忆保存在本地 SQLite 文件中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:421-452","lib/index.js:473-495","lib/index.js:588-620","lib/db.js:21-25"]}
{"unit_id":"Marquez807__dsh-experience-memory#card-en","repo":"Marquez807/dsh-experience-memory","commit":"e3fddecf171b3a02f5c892b72b30047c42449587","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"experience-memory adds long-term workspace memory to DSH. It injects relevant lessons into the prompt and provides tools to recall, record, review, and retire them. Unverified records stay as candidates; domain-wide lessons require confirmation in two workspaces. Data is stored locally in SQLite.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:421-452","lib/index.js:473-495","lib/index.js:588-620","lib/db.js:21-25"]}
